{"parentUuid":"ad64af19-4339-47af-a6bd-fd9aa87bae34","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"thinking":" I'm looking at what the user is asking for here — they want to design an Obsidian Skill that takes raw, heterogeneous sources and compiles them into a structured wiki or knowledge base. This seems like a design conversation rather than a coding task, so I should think through the architecture thoughtfully. I'm also noticing there's mention of an existing Obsidian Skill and an `.agents` directory structure, which suggests there's already some foundation in place that I should examine first.","type":"thinking","signature":""}],"id":"msg_69edeedd-7c36-4648-aa17-fed3f694181c","model":"claude-opus-4-8","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51829,"output_tokens":305,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"88306788-b6ec-4093-ab79-bef41e20b995","timestamp":"2026-06-10T02:32:41.418Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/hsw/Applications/Notes/Notebook","sessionId":"f9dc6c53-da48-4d6f-9c68-b9a1708ad6dc","version":"2.1.175","gitBranch":"main","forkedFrom":{"sessionId":"bba7f74d-801e-4a61-b814-3091cafeb904","messageUuid":"88306788-b6ec-4093-ab79-bef41e20b995"}}
{"parentUuid":"88306788-b6ec-4093-ab79-bef41e20b995","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"这是个值得好好想清楚的设计问题。在给方案之前，我先摸清现状——现有的 Obsidian Skill 是怎么设计的、`.agents` 和当前 vault 的结构、有没有相关的记忆。","type":"text"}],"id":"msg_69edeedd-7c36-4648-aa17-fed3f694181c","model":"claude-opus-4-8","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51829,"output_tokens":305,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"78f8f181-705a-42b6-a04f-102352ceeb5d","timestamp":"2026-06-10T02:32:42.083Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/hsw/Applications/Notes/Notebook","sessionId":"f9dc6c53-da48-4d6f-9c68-b9a1708ad6dc","version":"2.1.175","gitBranch":"main","forkedFrom":{"sessionId":"bba7f74d-801e-4a61-b814-3091cafeb904","messageUuid":"78f8f181-705a-42b6-a04f-102352ceeb5d"}}
